<?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="../assets/xml/rss.xsl" media="all"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>ncouture.github.io (Posts about appengine)</title><link>https://ncouture.github.io/</link><description></description><atom:link href="https://ncouture.github.io/categories/appengine.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><language>en</language><copyright>Contents © 2025 &lt;a href="mailto:nicolas@stormvault.net"&gt;@UnixNick&lt;/a&gt; </copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 19:38:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>Nikola (getnikola.com)</generator><docs>http://blogs.law.harvard.edu/tech/rss</docs><item><title>Google I/O 2016 Web Application Installation Steps</title><link>https://ncouture.github.io/posts/google-io-2016-web-application-installation-steps/</link><dc:creator>@UnixNick</dc:creator><description>&lt;p&gt;
My personal notes on installing the I/O 2016 Web Application (in March 2016).
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
goapp deploy -application &amp;lt;app-id&amp;gt; -version &amp;lt;v&amp;gt; dist/backend/.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-org225efd2" class="outline-2"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="org225efd2"&gt;Configure Firebase&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-2" id="text-org225efd2"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
You must use the legacy Firebase dashboard. Do not use the gcloud console. –2016-05-30
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol class="org-ol"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create firebase.com legacy application (&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;.firebaseio.com)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get application secret from &lt;a href="https://ncouture.github.io/"&gt;https://&lt;/a&gt;&amp;lt;app ID&amp;gt;.firebaseio.com/?page=Admin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insert secret in backend/server.config.&amp;lt;env&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;"firebase": {
  "secret": "&amp;lt;secret key&amp;gt;",
  "shards": [
    "https://&amp;lt;app ID&amp;gt;.firebaseio.com/"
  ]
},
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class="org-ol"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable Google Plus API
&lt;ul class="org-ul"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/"&gt;https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure credentials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-orgf05839d" class="outline-3"&gt;
&lt;h3 id="orgf05839d"&gt;CANCELLED Google Cloud Firebase Console does &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; work   &lt;span class="tag"&gt;&lt;span class="CANCELLED"&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-3" id="text-orgf05839d"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;a href="https://github.com/GoogleChrome/ioweb2016/pull/514#issuecomment-205866122"&gt;https://github.com/GoogleChrome/ioweb2016/pull/514#issuecomment-205866122&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul class="org-ul"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://console.firebase.google.com/project/"&gt;https://console.firebase.google.com/project/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;lt;project name&amp;gt;/settings/database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database secrets
&lt;ul class="org-ul"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show existing legacy token&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create custom database authentication tokens using a legacy Firebase token generator. At least one secret must exist at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-org74c9978" class="outline-2"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="org74c9978"&gt;Deploy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-2" id="text-org74c9978"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
These are my personal notes. Tested on Debian stretch.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
See &lt;a href="https://github.com/GoogleChrome/ioweb2016"&gt;https://github.com/GoogleChrome/ioweb2016&lt;/a&gt; for more detailed instructions.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-orgc6f0956" class="outline-3"&gt;
&lt;h3 id="orgc6f0956"&gt;Download Google App Engine SDK for Go&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-3" id="text-orgc6f0956"&gt;
&lt;ul class="org-ul"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://cloud.google.com/appengine/downloads#Google_App_Engine_SDK_for_Go"&gt;https://cloud.google.com/appengine/downloads#Google_App_Engine_SDK_for_Go&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;unzip go_appengine_sdk_linux_&amp;lt;arch&amp;gt;_&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;.zip
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-org72f2234" class="outline-3"&gt;
&lt;h3 id="org72f2234"&gt;Configure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-3" id="text-org72f2234"&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;mv go_appengine ~/.go_appengine
export PATH=~/.go_appengine:"$PATH"
export GOPATH=~/.go_appengine/gopath
export GOROOT=~/.go_appengine/goroot
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-org0ec053f" class="outline-3"&gt;
&lt;h3 id="org0ec053f"&gt;Install node dependencies&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-3" id="text-org0ec053f"&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;npm install
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-org1af5cdc" class="outline-3"&gt;
&lt;h3 id="org1af5cdc"&gt;Build&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-3" id="text-org1af5cdc"&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;gulp serve:dist --env prod
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-orge71df5e" class="outline-3"&gt;
&lt;h3 id="orge71df5e"&gt;Deploy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-3" id="text-orge71df5e"&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;gulp deploy:firebaserules --env prod
goapp deploy -application &amp;lt;application ID&amp;gt; -version &amp;lt;version number&amp;gt; dist/backend/.
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-org1a4baa5" class="outline-2"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="org1a4baa5"&gt;Temporary API&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-2" id="text-org1a4baa5"&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-orgb51acdb" class="outline-3"&gt;
&lt;h3 id="orgb51acdb"&gt;Enable in dist&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-3" id="text-orgb51acdb"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
After building the app:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;cp -r app/temporary_api/ dist/app/
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="outline-container-org6ea81f5" class="outline-2"&gt;
&lt;h2 id="org6ea81f5"&gt;Live Stream&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="outline-text-2" id="text-org6ea81f5"&gt;
&lt;ul class="org-ul"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://localhost:3000/io2016/api/v1/livestream"&gt;http://localhost:3000/io2016/api/v1/livestream&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description><category>app</category><category>appengine</category><category>deploy</category><category>dist</category><category>go</category><category>io2016</category><category>progressive web application</category><guid>https://ncouture.github.io/posts/google-io-2016-web-application-installation-steps/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 17 Sep 2016 15:09:12 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>